# @hub-lanes

# ── CONSOLE PREVIEW DEPLOY AND QA (BH-5909) ──────────────────────────────────
# Every 5 minutes: one Cloudflare Pages preview deploy per open console-ui PR
# head (same-repo heads only), a browser QA run of it as a read-only session,
# then one PR comment with the preview URL, QA COVERAGE and QA: PASS|FAIL for
# the head. Off by default: CONSOLE_PREVIEW_DEPLOY (settings row) is 0 until the
# first green proof. Off switch: bin/harness-ctl.sh off console-preview-deploy.
*/5 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/console-preview-deploy.sh >> /root/harness/logs/console-preview-deploy.log 2>&1
